# What git ignores in this repository.
# An ignore rule prevents accidents; it does not replace the rules in .github/CONTRIBUTING.md.

# --- Copyrighted and secret material: never commit ---------------------------

# Game images and dumps. Freely licensed test software will get its own folder and an exception here.
# The Mega Drive extension ".md" is left out, because every document here uses it.
*.gb
*.gbc
*.gba
*.nds
*.dsi
*.3ds
*.cia
*.cci
*.nes
*.fds
*.sfc
*.smc
*.n64
*.z64
*.v64
*.gcm
*.gcz
*.rvz
*.wbfs
*.wad
*.wux
*.xci
*.nsp
*.sms
*.gg
*.gen
*.32x
*.gdi
*.cdi
*.chd
*.iso
*.cue
*.cso
*.pbp
*.pkg
*.vpk
*.xbe
*.xex
*.rom
*.bin

# Firmware, BIOS images, and keys.
*.bios
*.firm
*.nand
*.keys
prod.keys
title.keys
aes_keys.txt
boot9.bin
boot11.bin
[Bb][Ii][Oo][Ss]/
firmware/

